hbb{Z}$"}, {"id": "G11_TB_12_2_12_9*_б", "current_skill": "G11_S07_03", "q": "Решите уравнение: $|\\sin x - \\dfrac{1}{2}| + |\\sin x - \\dfrac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}| = \\dfrac{\\sqrt{3} - 1}{2}$", "key": "$x \\in \\left[\\dfrac{\\pi}{6} + 2\\pi k; \\dfrac{\\pi}{3} + 2\\pi k\\right] \\cup \\left[\\dfrac{2\\pi}{3} + 2\\pi k; \\dfrac{5\\pi}{6"}, {"id": "G11_TB_12_2_12_9*_в", "current_skill": "G11_S07_03", "q": "Решите уравнение: $|2^{x}-4|+|4-\\sqrt{x}|=2^{x}-\\sqrt{x}$", "key": "$x \\in [2; 16]$"}, {"id": "G11_TB_12_2_12_9*_г", "current_skill": "G11_S07_03", "q": "Решите уравнение: $| \\log_{3} x - 2 | + | x^{2} - 11x + 18 | = \\log_{3} x - x^{2} + 11x - 20$", "key": "$x = 9$"}, {"id": "G11_TB_12_3_12_10_a", "current_skill": "G11_S07_03", "q": "Решите неравенство: $|3x-6| > x+2$", "key": "$(-\\infty; 1) \\cup (4; +\\infty)$"}, {"id": "G11_TB_12_3_12_10_b", "current_skill": "G11_S07_03", "q": "Решите неравенство: $|2x-5| < x-1$", "key": "$(2; 4)$"}, {"id": "G11_TB_12_3_12_10_c", "current_skill": "G11_S07_03", "q": "Решите неравенство: $|3x - 7| > 2x - 3$", "key": "$(-\\infty; 2) \\cup (4; +\\infty)$"}, {"id": "G11_TB_12_3_12_10_d", "current_skill": "G11_S07_03", "q": "Решите неравенство: $|2x-7|<0{,}5x+2$", "key": "$(2; 6)$"}, {"id": "G11_TB_12_3_12_11_a", "current_skill": "G11_S07_03", "q": "Решите неравенство: $\\dfrac{|x-1|+10}{4|x-1|+3}>2$", "key": "$(\\dfrac{3}{7}; \\dfrac{11}{7})$"}, {"id": "G11_TB_12_3_12_11_b", "current_skill": "G11_S07_03", "q": "Решите неравенство: $\\dfrac{|x-2|+8}{3|x-2|+1}<3$", "key": "$(-\\infty; \\dfrac{11}{8}) \\cup (\\dfrac{21}{8}; +\\infty)$"}, {"id": "G11_TB_12_3_12_11_c", "current_skill": "G11_S07_03", "q": "Решите неравенство: $\\dfrac{|x-3|+6}{2|x-3|+1}<4$", "key": "$(-\\infty; \\dfrac{19}{7}) \\cup (\\dfrac{23}{7}; +\\infty)$"}, {"id": "G11_TB_12_3_12_11_d", "current_skill": "G11_S07_03", "q": "Решите неравенство: $\\dfrac{|x-2|+7}{3|x-2|+2}>1$", "key": "$(-0{,}5; 4{,}5)$"}, {"id": "G11_TB_12_3_12_12_a", "current_skill": "G11_S07_03", "